Package: RiemTS
Type: Package
Title: Time Series on Riemannian Manifolds
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Time series toolkit for data supported on Riemannian manifolds. 
    A common interface for various manifold operations (geodesic distance, 
    exponential/logarithm maps, Frechet mean, parallel transport, and Frechet
    mean) is provided. Manifolds supported include the Bures-Wasserstein and 
    Log-Euclidean manifolds of SPD matrices, the Grassmannian, and the sphere. 
